# QA approval before promotion

## Rule

A candidate MUST pass the applicable QA Gate before it is eligible for promotion from `outputs/` to `release/`. A failed or incomplete verification MUST block promotion.

## Notes

Draft corporate rule proposed during the IASI methodology exercise. Requires corporate approval before becoming binding.
